WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Nemi sura da suna ko lamba, sannan ka zaɓe ta.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Zaɓi ayar farko da ta ƙarshe. Saurari sashen kafin ka karanta.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Zaɓi kalma don duba yadda ake furta ta da sauraron makaranci.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Ba da izinin makirufo, ɗauki murya sannan ka tsayar, ko ka loda sauti. Bayan nazari, zaɓi kalmar da aka yi wa alama don duba ta.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Zaɓi harshenka. Nuna ko ɓoye rubutun lafazi da ƙa’idojin tajwidi na gaba.

